{
  "_about": "FNV creatures on their own rig, keyed by FNV skeleton folder. project: FO4 file and folder name (Actors\\<project>\\...), the movement type's MNAM and iState_<project>. template: the vanilla race whose race, body parts, skin and movement type are copied (unarmed: the FO4 weapon whose impact set the race's own copy of the template's unarmed weapon hits with). clips: FO4 clip role -> FNV .kf under the skeleton folder. attacks: attack clip -> [melee event, power, label]. parts: template body-part node -> our bone. pose_bones: the pose matcher's ragdoll bones in the template's roles (pelvis, chest, upper arm). guns: ranged clip role -> [the equip slot (an EQUP EditorID; the race adds it when its template lacks it) of the guns that clip fires; the bones whose subtrees that clip plays on over its movement (the rest keep their aim); the FNV node those guns fire from (the slot's WEAPON node goes there, the race's ZNAM naming it)]. See docs/fork/fo4_own_rig.md#table.",
